sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OAuth as OAuth Proxy Sidecar<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Dashboard as Ray Head Dashboard<br/>8265/TCP HTTP
    participant Client as Ray Client
    participant HeadSvc as Ray Head Service<br/>10001/TCP mTLS
    participant Worker as Ray Workers<br/>10001/TCP mTLS
    participant Operator as CodeFlare Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Admission Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User, Dashboard: Flow 1: RayCluster OAuth Dashboard Access (OpenShift)
    User->>Router: GET https://ray-dashboard-{cluster}<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    Router->>OAuth: Reencrypt TLS<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    Note right of OAuth: OpenShift OAuth Token validation
    OAuth->>Dashboard: Proxy request<br/>8265/TCP HTTP (localhost)
    Dashboard-->>OAuth: Dashboard response
    OAuth-->>Router: HTTPS response
    Router-->>User: Dashboard HTML

    Note over Client, Worker: Flow 2: RayCluster mTLS Client Connection
    Client->>Router: Ray client connect<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS Passthrough
    Note right of Client: Client cert signed by<br/>per-cluster CA
    Router->>HeadSvc: TLS Passthrough<br/>10001/TCP mTLS
    HeadSvc->>Worker: Distribute work<br/>10001/TCP mTLS
    Worker-->>HeadSvc: Results
    HeadSvc-->>Router: Response
    Router-->>Client: Results

    Note over Operator, Webhook: Flow 3: RayCluster mTLS Certificate Bootstrap
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create CA Secret<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    Note right of Operator: RSA 2048-bit CA key + cert<br/>1 year validity
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Secret created
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: RayCluster create/update<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    Note right of Webhook: Inject oauth-proxy sidecar<br/>Inject mTLS init containers<br/>Mount CA volumes
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated pod spec
    Note over Worker: Init container runs:<br/>openssl CLI generates<br/>node cert signed by CA
